local Knit=require(game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage"):WaitForChild("Knit")); local Http=require(game:GetService("HttpService")); local S=Knit.CreateService({Name="TradingService",Client={List=Knit.CreateSignal(),Buy=Knit.CreateSignal(),Cancel=Knit.CreateSignal(),GetListings=Knit.CreateSignal(),TradeUpdated=Knit.CreateSignal()}})
function S:ListItem(p,index,currency,price,note) local d=self.Services.PlayerDataService:GetData(p); index=tonumber(index); price=tonumber(price); if not d or not d.tradeData or not d.Inventory.Fish[index] or price<=0 then return false,"Invalid" end; if #d.tradeData.ActiveListings>=d.tradeData.ListingSlots then return false,"No listing slots" end; local fish=table.remove(d.Inventory.Fish,index); local id=Http:GenerateGUID(false); d.tradeData.ActiveListings[id]={Id=id,Fish=fish,Currency=currency=="Gems" and "Gems" or "Coins",Price=price,Note=tostring(note or ""),SellerUserId=p.UserId,ExpiresAt=os.time()+86400}; self.Services.PlayerDataService:SaveData(p); return true,id end
function S:BuyItem(p,sellerId,id) local buyer=self.Services.PlayerDataService:GetData(p); local seller=game:GetService("Players"):GetPlayerByUserId(tonumber(sellerId)); local sd=seller and self.Services.PlayerDataService:GetData(seller); if not buyer or not sd then return false,"Unavailable" end; local listing=sd.tradeData.ActiveListings[id]; if not listing or listing.SellerUserId==p.UserId then return false,"Unavailable" end; local wallet=buyer.Currency[listing.Currency]; if wallet<listing.Price then return false,"Insufficient funds" end; local tax=(listing.Currency=="Gems" and .15 or .10)*(buyer.tradeData.VerifiedTrader and .5 or 1); buyer.Currency[listing.Currency]-=listing.Price; seller.Currency[listing.Currency]+=math.floor(listing.Price*(1-tax)); table.insert(buyer.Inventory.Fish,listing.Fish); table.remove(sd.tradeData.ActiveListings,table.find(sd.tradeData.ActiveListings,listing)); table.insert(buyer.tradeData.TradeHistory,{Type="Buy",Price=listing.Price,Currency=listing.Currency,Tax=tax,Timestamp=os.time(),OtherParty=seller.UserId}); self.Services.PlayerDataService:SaveData(p); self.Services.PlayerDataService:SaveData(seller); return true end
function S:KnitInit() self.Client.List:Connect(function(...) return self:ListItem(...) end); self.Client.Buy:Connect(function(...) return self:BuyItem(...) end) end
return S
